    "detailed_description": "<strong>Delilah</strong> is an old-school FPS set in a world divided between Humanity and Hell. Its main goal is to capture the magical formula of the great classics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/6e544518d1dc20c1efc98914b8cc78c6.poster.avif?t=1733588299\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/6e544518d1dc20c1efc98914b8cc78c6.webm?t=1733588299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/6e544518d1dc20c1efc98914b8cc78c6.mp4?t=1733588299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two characters with unique loadouts<br></li><li>Varied encounters, from tight horror experiences to slaughter maps<br></li><li>Seven episodes (planned), each with a distinct theme and story<br></li><li>Authentic 2.5D graphics in 256 colors, multi-directional monster sprites<br></li><li>MIDI tunes emulating sounds straight from the 90's<br></li><li>Custom game engine that supports 3d and dynamic level geometry</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/4e171820b746b4301ee3ad4062b1cfe6.poster.avif?t=1733588299\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/4e171820b746b4301ee3ad4062b1cfe6.webm?t=1733588299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/4e171820b746b4301ee3ad4062b1cfe6.mp4?t=1733588299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A century ago a great hero has saved our species by closing the gates of Hell, but the billions of demons already on Earth didn't just magically disappear. Instead, while Humanity was slowly reconquering the planet, several Arch Devils have adapted to the rules of our dimension. They formed their own twisted governments (known as Circles), to use their populations as human shields. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002610/extras/c3aa80f6ae03c0499129f6ebd7c71459.avif?t=1733588299\" /></div><br>Our two protagonists were born into this century-long cold war: one is an enforcer of the Transylvanian Daemocratic Circle, the other is an Anointed defender of Humanity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the developer</h2>Borington is a one-person game development team from Transylvania. My previous games include 'BlackChain' and 'Rum &amp; Gun', both available on Steam.",
